# Project Goals

## Primary Objectives

- **Stable movie poll for group nights** - No duplicate entries, idempotent vote operations
- **Maintain tech stack** - Keep Go + Chi + GORM + SQLite + Templ + HTMX (no framework swaps)
- **Admin dashboard stability** - Remain fully functional during feature work
- **Railway deployment** - Don't break Make targets in `makefile`

## Success Criteria

- `make dev` runs with hot reload
- Zero data loss across releases; existing DB file remains valid
- Results page loads < 1s p95 in release mode
- Admin panel loads < 2s with full functionality

## Canonical Documentation

Always read these docs first in every session:

- `README.md` (architecture + commands)
- `docs/architecture.md` (system overview)
- `docs/TODO.md` (current priorities)

## Development Scope

This is a **Semi-Public** project with moderate production requirements:

- Basic security measures (session management, admin auth)
- Proper error handling and logging
- Moderate scalability considerations
- Basic CI/CD through Railway deployment
